WEBVTT

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.480
I set the Pendulum Scale with 
Scale 1 D/D Savant Galilei

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:19.150
and Scale 10 D/D Savant Kepler!

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:33.650
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 9 simultaneously!

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.680
The great power that shakes my soul,

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:41.420
reside in my body and become the new 
light that cuts through the darkness!

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:43.420
Pendulum Summon!

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:47.120
Appear, my monsters!

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:51.650
The three ultimate gods 
that rule all the kings!

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:56.500
D/D/D Doom King Armageddons!

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:06.100
Pendulum Summon confirmed!

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.710
Summoning energy at normal levels!

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.050
Good.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:13.190
If we can keep it stabilized...

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:31.550
Yuya Sakaki.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:36.350
President!

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:39.400
We've cleared our goal!

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:41.650
Today's test was a success!

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.850
Congratulations.

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:58.550
Leo Corporation's Pendulum Cards 
are one step closer to completion.

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:02.920
But they're not perfect.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:08.040
Compared to Yuya Sakaki's 
original Pendulum Cards,

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:11.950
their energy quality and 
output are unfavorable.

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:16.600
They're far from ready to 
be used in an actual battle.

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:20.120
I apologize.

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:22.900
I will push the development team harder.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:25.850
We'll make sure they're ready by 
the start of the championship.

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:29.350
That's the deadline.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:39.540
We must not fail in Maiami City's tournament.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:45.200
No matter where the duelists come from.

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:52.310
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:57.120
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:00.400
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.400
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:23.180
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:26.590
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:35.330
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:39.900
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.100
Impulse  Got it got it

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:47.310
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:58.070
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:04.990
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:08.930
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:12.330
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:22.610
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:25.950
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:35.990
Beyond Pendulum

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:50.700
Yuya hasn't moved for a long time.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:53.550
Yesterday, he was happy that he only needed

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:56.240
two more wins to enter the 
Junior Youth Championship.

00:04:56.240 --> 00:05:00.210
Maybe all the quizzes made 
his overworked brain shiver.

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:07.650
Congratulations for winning 
two in a row, Yuya.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:09.150
Thank you.

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:14.260
But you don't look happy for 
someone offering congratulations.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.550
I am happy.

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:20.660
In your battle against the cooking 
duelist, you learned about hospitality.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:22.860
In the battle against the quiz duelist,

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:25.820
you learned that dueling is 
a tool for communication,

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:28.400
allowing you to get consecutive wins.

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:35.010
My "Turn Yuya Sakaki Into a Pro" 
plan is off to a good start.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.200
Then be happier.

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:40.900
It's your job to make people happy!

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.490
My job?

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:45.220
Pros must make people happy!

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.040
If you want to become a pro duelist,

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:55.600
you must astound the audience with your 
dueling and be showered with their applause!

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:59.470
Right now, you're still 
within my expectations.

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:01.000
Within expectations?

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.750
A pro surpasses the audience's expectations.

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:09.850
In the next match, I want you to astound me!

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:19.940
A pro surpasses the 
audience's expectations...

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.500
He's right.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:27.080
When my dad flew through the sky for 
the first time in an Action Duel,

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:30.380
the audience was astounded.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.320
Of course I know your father.

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:40.260
He's a pioneer who built up Action Duels 
into the success it experiences today,

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:42.780
so I admire him deeply.

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.700
Reiji Akaba.

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.450
He also surprised me.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.320
Fusion Summon!

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:54.300
Be born, D/D/D Flame King Genghis!

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.460
Synchro Summon!

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:02.740
Be born, Level 7 D/D/D Gust King Alexander!

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:05.370
Xyz Summon!

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:10.540
Be born, Rank 4 Wave King Caesar!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:15.750
He Fusion, Synchro and Xyz 
Summoned one after another.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:17.750
Pendulum Summon!

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:21.160
Appear, my monsters!

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:24.050
He even Pendulum Summoned.

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:28.150
That's not all.  He...

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:30.550
I see it.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:33.930
I see that Pendulum Summon 
can evolve even further.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:40.940
Pendulum Summon can evolve even further...

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:45.400
Why can he see it, but I can't?

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.300
Yuya!

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.380
Where are you going?

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:57.820
383!  384!  385!  386!

00:07:58.350 --> 00:08:00.150
387!  388!

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:04.500
I don't know what I'm 
supposed to do, Principal!

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:08.750
What can I do to see what's ahead?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.270
393!

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:11.970
The path is long!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.940
But don't give up!

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:16.300
A journey begins with the first step!

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:20.080
Keep taking one step at a time!

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:24.750
But I can't take a step 
if I don't know my path!

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:27.290
What can I do to see my path?

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:30.490
I can't see it at all!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:33.260
We used to walk our path together,

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:37.850
but I can no longer see what's 
in my daughter's heart!

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:40.970
Daughter?

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:47.750
Yuzu recently hasn't come to school.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.400
She's with Sora again today?

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.540
Yeah.  It's his fifth match.

00:08:55.850 --> 00:09:03.820
With this, my turn is over!

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:11.300
Now commence your turn!

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:14.500
Wow!  That was really entertaining!

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.770
It's almost as good as Yuya's 
entertainment dueling!

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:19.650
Calm down and draw!

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:21.370
Finish it this turn!

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:22.950
Okay, okay.

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:28.300
Since that day, it's like you're forcing 
yourself to be more intense.  But whatever.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.820
My turn.  I draw!

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:34.520
All right!  I got Edge Imp Sabres!

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:39.600
Since I showed you all my moves, 
you should know what's in my hand.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.330
What would you do?

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:43.000
There's only one thing to do!

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:45.340
I would use the Polymerization 
card in my hand

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:48.530
in my hand to fuse Edge Imp Sabres 
and Fluffal Bear together!

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.580
Exactly!  You're learning, Yuzu!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:56.010
I activate the spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:01.350
I fuse Edge Imp Sabres and Fluffal Bear!

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:04.500
Devil's claws and beast's fangs!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.700
Become one in the whirlpool of mystery!

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.560
Show your new power and look!

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.400
Fusion Summon!

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:16.460
Appear, the hair-raising beast 
that slashes everything!

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:19.250
Frightfur Bear!

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:24.770
Frightfur Bear attacks you directly!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:33.920
How glorious!

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:36.200
Nice!
Best in Japan!

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.840
And it's done.

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.390
My fifth opponent was nothing special.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:53.440
But it's fine because I now know that 
you're getting the hang of Fusion.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.820
I won't think about anything else anymore!

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:58.940
I have to master Fusion Summon

00:10:58.940 --> 00:11:03.180
and use it to battle in the 
Junior Youth Championship!

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:08.660
So that I can defeat Masumi Koutsu!

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:16.320
Masumi, are you searching 
for him again today?

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:17.900
Of course.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:23.560
I must find the man in the black mask 
and ask him about Professor Marco!

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:26.900
But is he really the culprit?

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:29.760
You didn't actually see him use Xyz.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:34.400
That's why I must find him 
and see if he uses Xyz!

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:39.450
She's very persistent.

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:41.250
Don't say that.

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:43.480
If she hears you, she'll pummel you.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:49.720
But if we don't find the culprit 
soon, something bad may happen.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:56.360
Yeah.  It's rumored that several LDS Top 
Team members have also been defeated.

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:59.400
He may even show up in front of us.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:12.050
What do you want?

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:15.750
You want to battle me again?

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:23.690
The man Gongenzaka believes you're also 
a man, so he has a request to ask you!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.400
That's...

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:12.350
The Top Team members were attacked here.

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:16.450
What are you doing there?

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:23.900
Can it be that Professor Marco was 
also attacked by that creature?

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:34.900
I could've won one turn earlier.

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:38.080
The opponent's monster 
had 1500 attack points.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.320
Fluffal Leo has 1600 attack points,

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:43.950
so if you summoned that 
instead of Fluffal Bear...

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:48.950
I knew that too, but I wanted 
to show you Fusion Summoning.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:52.580
Because you didn't fully 
comprehend last time.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:54.750
I'm fine with Fusion now.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:59.320
I practiced a lot, so I only need to 
polish my skills in an actual match.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.950
You're full of confidence.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:05.750
Then let me see your Fusion Summon, Yuzu.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:09.430
I feel like having one more match.

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.060
I'll take you on!

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:16.860
You're Masumi Koutsu!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:22.800
Do you know what's happening in Maiami City?

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:24.300
What's happening?

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:29.450
A mystery duelist is attacking many people.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.960
Attacking many people?

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:36.250
The victims are all connected to LDS.

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:42.560
But they can't tell us what happened 
because they've all disappeared.

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:44.350
Disappeared?

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:46.700
They're missing.

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:51.500
Professor Marco and LDS Top Team members...

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:55.850
After they were attacked, they vanished.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.950
But it's only a rumor within LDS.

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:03.900
Please tell me where he is!

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:04.950
You know, right?

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:06.580
Who?

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:10.890
The man in the black mask 
that was with you last time!

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:22.150
If I caught him back then, I could've 
stopped everything that happened since!

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:24.800
It's your fault for letting him escape!

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:27.510
What?  I don't know anything!

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:29.250
Don't lie!

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:31.750
Professor Marco vanished.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:34.750
Strong and kind Professor Marco...

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:37.750
He might be in pain!

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:41.890
I have to find him as soon as possible!

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:44.620
Tell me where he is!

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:47.090
I said that I don't know!

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:51.200
Then why were you with him 
at the scene of the crime?

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:57.870
If you're going to play dumb, I'll be 
a duelist and make you talk by dueling!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:02.150
LDS's Fusion Summon isn't that impressive.

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:04.250
You can defeat her easily.

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:05.840
You want me to accept her challenge?

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:09.900
Yeah.  You said that you 
were done with practice

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:12.550
and want to polish your 
skills in an actual match.

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:17.150
Defeat me easily?

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:20.800
Did you forget that she lost to me before?

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:23.750
Yuzu is different than last time.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:25.100
What's different about her?

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:32.200
I think you'll learn that LDS's 
Fusion Summon isn't impressive.

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:39.250
Those words are an insult to Professor 
Marco who taught me Fusion Summoning!

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:40.450
I won't forgive you!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.550
I'll defeat you first!

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:47.820
I don't think you should duel me.

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:50.050
You'll lose even more confidence.

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:51.150
Be quiet!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:54.660
I'll teach you that LDS is the greatest!

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:57.230
You're LDS too?

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:11.010
If you're LDS, I'm your opponent!

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:35.570
You're the one who's been attacking everyone?

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.700
Bring it on.

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:46.710
Duel me!

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:48.900
Stop it, Syun!

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:51.920
Stop doing this!

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:54.500
Ute!

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:58.750
I told you before that this 
place isn't our battlefield!

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.360
They're not our enemy!

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:05.100
This is my battlefield!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.950
I must do this to get Ruri back!

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:11.200
If you're going to interfere, 
I'll defeat you too!

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:13.250
I found the culprit!

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:15.170
Come quick, Yaiba and Hokuto!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.140
Wait!

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.400
We don't know if he's really the culprit!

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:21.800
Ruri?

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:25.000
Why are you here, Ruri?

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:28.350
Did you escape by yourself?

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:30.000
Ruri!

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:37.100
Ruri...

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:40.470
She's not Ruri.

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:48.510
Contact LDS and tell them 
to send as many as possible!

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:49.980
Understood!

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:52.440
Yaiba is talking to them right now!

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:55.600
That's right!  The warehouse 
area near the harbor!

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:06.650
Yuzu is also trying to improve by 
learning Fusion Summon from Sora.

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:10.200
What should I do?

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:13.350
Ouch!

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:15.350
Don't suddenly get in my way!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.250
You're...

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.640
Yuya Sakaki!

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:21.340
You're not apologizing for crashing into me?

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:24.810
You're one to talk!  It's your fault!

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:27.400
That's enough!  We have to go!

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:28.510
Right.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.480
Did something happen?

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:34.450
We found the culprit.  The mystery duelist!

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.830
This card doesn't suit you.

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:49.500
How upsetting.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:53.770
I don't like it when a stranger 
criticizes my present.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:20:00.500
I'm willing to teach you 
how wonderful that card is.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.450
Sora!

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:08.150
Stop it, Sora!

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:09.620
You too!

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:11.190
Masumi!

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:31.500
Masumi!

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.200
Where's the culprit?

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:34.860
He vanished.

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:38.560
Yuzu, are you okay?

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:40.960
He disappeared again.

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:47.560
They looked at me and said 
that I'm Ruri or not Ruri.

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:49.800
What's that all about?

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:51.560
I don't know.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:54.600
I don't understand anything!

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:59.000
Why does my bracelet glow?  Why 
do they vanish when you arrive?

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.600
Yuzu?

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:10.800
Aww...  Your cards are all over the place.

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:16.600
Here.

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:19.680
LDS has arrived!

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:25.200
I'm sorry!  The culprit was just here!

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:28.200
It's gonna get annoying soon.

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:30.840
Yuya, let's hurry up!

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:32.180
Right!

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:33.960
Hey!

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:36.780
I heard that you have to win two more times

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:39.180
to enter the Junior Youth Championship.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:41.650
How did you know?

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:43.880
Well, try your best to win.

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:45.920
But it might be impossible.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:50.080
Impossible?  Hey!

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:53.080
Yuzu?  Sora?

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:02.440
I forgot to pick this up.

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:04.000
Is it Yuzu's?

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:05.640
Polymerization...

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:18.940
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:28.420
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:40.430
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:45.670
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:51.110
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:56.370
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.570 --> 00:23:01.970
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.970 --> 00:23:06.390
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:12.360
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:17.770
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.770 --> 00:23:23.100
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.100 --> 00:23:32.410
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:40.660
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.560 --> 00:23:50.080
According to my fortunetelling, 
my next opponent is...

00:23:50.080 --> 00:23:51.410
My soulmate of destiny?

00:23:51.410 --> 00:23:54.520
Oh my!  Mieru can't handle it!

00:23:54.520 --> 00:23:55.800
I wonder what he's like?

00:23:55.800 --> 00:23:59.220
A super cool elite duelist?  
Or a wild beefcake?

00:23:59.220 --> 00:24:02.040
I can also go for a kind family man!

00:24:02.040 --> 00:24:05.760
Hurry up and get here, 
Mieru's future darling!

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:08.230
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:24:08.230 --> 00:24:12.280
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Fortunetelling Girl  Mieru Houchun

00:24:12.280 --> 00:24:14.240
The fun is only getting started!
